                "text": "Joined a bipartisan group of 20 in D.C. to fix rising health-care costs \u2014 not preserve an ACA status quo where premiums rose 60% faster than inflation and 1 in 3 claims are denied. Our plan keeps what works and adds reforms that stabilize costs for families instead of boosting insurer profits.",
