                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Good to be on @ABC7NY yesterday discussing a centrist approach I\u2019m supporting in Washington that temporarily extends ACA premium tax credits while advancing real reforms to fix the law\u2019s core problems \u2014 premiums rising 60% faster than inflation, nearly 1 in 3 claims denied, and insurers making billions, even before the 2026 credit expiration. As written, the ACA is unsustainable and I\u2019m proud to support a bill that lowers costs now and strengthens the system for the long term.",
